title: "Ancient Greek World Atlas — Data Foundation"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
authors:
  - family-names: Liaskos
    given-names: Alexandros
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - ancient Greek world
  - historical GIS
  - gazetteer
  - archaeology
  - linked open data
abstract: >-
  A bilingual, source-aware and reproducible scholarly dataset of 226
  settlements, sanctuaries and polities associated with the ancient Greek
  world, with normalized chronology, spatial assertions, relationships,
  citations and external gazetteer alignments.
